          %p
            Therefore, for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Banach+spaces"} Banach spaces
            all the notions of “smooth function” collapse, whilst for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fr%C3%A9chet+spaces"} Fréchet spaces
            all of the notions coarser than
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Π
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Pi
            collapse.
